According to my research, Hitler's remains were exhumed, burned and their ashes scattered by the Soviet Union in 1970 to keep them from becoming a rallying point for fascists. The body was in an advanced state of decay when it was exhumed, and the remains were then burned and dumped into the Biederitz river. For many years it was believed that his skull had survived, but recent DNA analysis has revealed that the skull was actually that of a woman, possibly Eva Braun. 

In other words, no genetic material of Adolf Hitler is known to exist, and even if it did it would certainly by out of the reach of a group of neo-Nazis operating on an amateur budget.

